 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of training steps and batch size. Each step involves a forward pass through the MLP/Gaussian splatter and a backward pass.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to the number of model parameters and the batch size (storing gradients and optimizer states).
